# Working trees are LF everywhere, including on Windows.
#
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` rewrites every file git touches to CRLF on
# checkout, and Prettier — whose `endOfLine` default is `lf` — then fails the
# format gate on the entire changed set. That is a checkout artefact, not a
# source defect, so it is fixed here rather than by relaxing the gate.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.db binary
